53
00:02:07,480 --> 00:02:10,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">P-Please let's not talk about that.</font>

54
00:02:10,190 --> 00:02:11,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Did something happen?</font>

55
00:02:12,020 --> 00:02:13,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When we were visiting Naruto
