56
00:02:13,730 --> 00:02:14,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shino!</font>

57
00:02:15,110 --> 00:02:18,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This girl fainted when she saw Naruto
