58
00:02:18,360 --> 00:02:19,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kiba!</font>

59
00:02:19,610 --> 00:02:21,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll... I'll be fine this time!</font>

60
00:02:22,830 --> 00:02:24,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I finally found you...!</font>

61
00:02:24,740 --> 00:02:28,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Grandma Tsunade, I need
