00:02:33,750 --> 00:02:35,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? Hinata!</font>

63
00:02:36,130 --> 00:02:37,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...</font>

64
00:02:37,170 --> 00:02:40,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Naruto is... so close!
— Hinata? Hinata! What's wrong?</font>

65
