<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your face looks a little red...</font>

66
00:02:44,320 --> 00:02:46,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do you have a fever or something? Huh?</font>

67
00:02:47,350 --> 00:02:48,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey...</font>

68
00:02:55,360 --> 00:02:56,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">H-Hey, Hinata...?!</font>

69
00:02:58,250 --> 00:02:59,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Hinata!</font>

70
00:03:00,150 --> 00:03:02,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you okay?!
Get a hold of yourself!</font>

