00:03:05,990 --> 00:03:11,120
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Scent Bug</font>

77
00:03:20,340 --> 00:03:22,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, you woke up.</font>

78
00:03:22,470 --> 00:03:24,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So Mizuki didn't know anything
