79
00:03:24,800 --> 00:03:27,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade interrogated him herself.</font>

80
00:03:29,300 --> 00:03:31,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He didn't have any information</font>

81
00:03:31,110 --> 00:03:33,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that would lead to Orochimaru's
current whereabouts...</font>

82
00:03:35,060 --> 00:03:39,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">After all that guy was nothing but
a disposable pawn to Orochimaru, huh.</font>

83
00:03:40,190 --> 00:03:41,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So it seems...</font>

84
00:03:41,950 --> 00:03:44,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We still don't know where
Sasuke went...</font>

85
00:03:44,530 --> 00:03:47,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And that's the result after
a desperate fight with Mizuki...</font>

86
00:03:48,410 --> 00:03:51,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That can't sit right with
Naruto either... huh?</font>

87
00:03:52,710 --> 00:03:55,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please Grandma Tsunade
