88
00:03:56,000 --> 00:03:57,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When I say no I mean no!</font>

89
00:03:58,090 --> 00:04:01,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As a result Tsunade-sama wasn't able
to concentrate on her work.</font>

90
00:04:02,550 --> 00:04:05,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto's been breathing down
her neck the whole time</font>

91
00:04:05,300 --> 00:04:07,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">asking her to let him go off
in search of Sasuke.</font>

92
00:04:08,100 --> 00:04:11,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So she sneaked out
of her office but...</font>

93
00:04:11,770 --> 00:04:13,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He was lying in wait for her here.</font>

94
00:04:15,060 --> 00:04:16,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...</font>

95
00:04:16,650 --> 00:04:18,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've asked you numerous times already!</font>

96
00:04:18,990 --> 00:04:21,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please let me go in search
of Sasuke!</font>

97
00:04:21,780 --> 00:04:24,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've told you numerous times already.
Impossible!</font>

98
00:04:24,990 --> 00:04:26,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why!</font>

99
00:04:26,930 --> 00:04:28,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You have some training to do!</font>

100
