<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't because Pervy Sage
isn't around!</font>

101
00:04:32,620 --> 00:04:36,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We have zero leads on either
Orochimaru and Sasuke.</font>

102
00:04:36,580 --> 00:04:37,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So how are you planning
to search for him?</font>

103
00:04:37,890 --> 00:04:40,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can figure it out somehow!</font>

104
00:04:40,300 --> 00:04:42,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If there aren't any leads
I'll go find some!</font>

105
00:04:42,880 --> 00:04:44,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So please let me go do it!</font>

106
00:04:45,070 --> 00:04:46,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're stubborn aren't you?</font>

107
00:04:46,720 --> 00:04:48,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're stubborn too,
Grandma Tsunade!</font>

108
00:04:49,060 --> 00:04:50,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Please let me go!
— No, you may not!</font>

109
00:04:50,670 --> 00:04:51,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I say I'm going, I'm going!</font>

110
00:04:51,960 --> 00:04:53,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shut up! No means no!</font>

111
00:04:59,190 --> 00:05:00,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Byakugan!</font>

112
00:05:05,990 --> 00:05:07,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right! Good work, Neji!</font>

113
00:05:08,490 --> 00:05:09,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Move in another half step
right there!</font>

114
00:05:09,700 --> 00:05:10,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes sir!</font>

115
00:05:22,550 --> 00:05:23,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sorry to keep you waiting.</font>

116
00:05:30,140 --> 00:05:31,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's take a break, Neji.</font>

117
00:05:32,430 --> 00:05:33,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes.</font>

118
00:05:37,810 --> 00:05:39,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Have some tea too.</font>

119
00:05:40,770 --> 00:05:41,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thank you...</font>

120
00:05:44,030 --> 00:05:48,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If Hinata was here
she should have observed a little.</font>

121
00:05:49,280 --> 00:05:51,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata prepared this...?</font>

122
00:05:52,610 --> 00:05:56,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It would supplement her training
by observing...</font>

123
00:06:12,760 --> 00:06:13,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Byakugan!</font>

124
00:06:29,410 --> 00:06:30,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's take a break.</font>

125
00:06:30,990 --> 00:06:33,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Yes.
— Food! Food!</font>

126
00:06:36,660 --> 00:06:38,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That was pretty well done.</font>

127
00:06:38,580 --> 00:06:40,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I would say that you're getting closer
to perfecting the technique.</font>

128
00:06:41,210 --> 00:06:42,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's thanks to you both.</font>

129
00:06:43,130 --> 00:06:46,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're so kind to join me
in my special training every day...</font>

130
00:06:46,510 --> 00:06:47,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're a team.</font>

131
00:06:48,130 --> 00:06:49,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When a comrade in the team
is in a fix</font>

132
