<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">one offers a helping hand.</font>

133
00:06:51,590 --> 00:06:53,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's only natural...</font>

134
00:06:53,800 --> 00:06:55,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A comrade...</font>

135
00:06:56,770 --> 00:07:01,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If a comrade suddenly disappears</font>

136
00:07:01,900 --> 00:07:03,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it must be awfully hard.</font>

137
00:07:05,520 --> 00:07:06,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're talking about Naruto,
aren't you?</font>

138
00:07:10,320 --> 00:07:13,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Isn't there some way
we could help him?</font>

139
00:07:14,120 --> 00:07:17,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'd like to help him out in
some way too... but...</font>

140
00:07:19,620 --> 00:07:22,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hokage-sama was telling Naruto...</font>

141
00:07:22,670 --> 00:07:24,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that there are no leads at all.</font>

142
00:07:27,960 --> 00:07:30,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There may be one resource...</font>

143
00:07:30,760 --> 00:07:31,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Really?!</font>

144
00:07:33,300 --> 00:07:34,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm talking about Bikochu.</font>

145
00:07:35,760 --> 00:07:36,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Bikochu?</font>

146
00:07:38,470 --> 00:07:40,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you talking about
those rare insects...?!</font>

147
00:07:41,890 --> 00:07:44,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have heard that they had
become extinct some time ago.</font>

148
00:07:44,900 --> 00:07:46,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Since there was a possibility
that they could become extinct</font>

149
00:07:46,900 --> 00:07:50,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the Aburame Clan discontinued
using them</font>

150
00:07:50,190 --> 00:07:53,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">so a minuscule number of them
should still be alive.</font>

151
00:07:54,780 --> 00:07:57,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade-sama, what are Bikochu?</font>

152
00:07:57,450 --> 00:08:00,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well... it's not surprising that
you don't know about them.</font>

153
00:08:01,370 --> 00:08:03,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The last time that Bikochu
were used</font>

154
00:08:03,370 --> 00:08:05,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">was before the last Great War...</font>

155
00:08:07,460 --> 00:08:10,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Bikochu are one kind of insect
used by insect handlers.</font>

156
00:08:11,380 --> 00:08:14,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Larvae which have hatched from eggs
become chrysalises in no time at all</font>

157
00:08:14,800 --> 00:08:16,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">then emerge and turn
into imagos.</font>

158
00:08:17,260 --> 00:08:19,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They are then made to
recognize scents...</font>

159
00:08:19,270 --> 00:08:22,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and they are able to track
even the faintest scent...</font>

160
00:08:22,230 --> 00:08:24,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to its source.</font>

161
00:08:25,350 --> 00:08:27,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Their olfactory sense is several thousand
times greater than a Ninja Hound's.</font>

162
00:08:28,400 --> 00:08:31,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They are insects capable of
exhibiting that skill in an exceptional way.</font>

163
00:08:33,880 --> 00:08:38,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However, Bikochu lay eggs
only once every several years...</font>

164
00:08:39,740 --> 00:08:41,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This year is actually the year
in which they lay eggs.</font>

165
00:08:42,080 --> 00:08:44,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And right now is exactly
the time when they hatch.</font>

166
00:08:45,290 --> 00:08:46,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see.</font>

167
00:08:46,750 --> 00:08:49,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There are still some of
Sasuke's belongings left in the village...</font>

168
00:08:49,500 --> 00:08:50,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right?</font>

169
00:08:51,010 --> 00:08:53,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If one makes the Bikochu
recognize that scent...</font>

170
00:08:53,880 --> 00:08:57,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We may be able to locate
Sasuke's whereabouts, right?</font>

171
00:08:59,470 --> 00:09:01,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is the probability
of finding a Bikochu?</font>

172
00:09:02,930 --> 00:09:06,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Frankly speaking not very high.
Perhaps 10%.</font>

173
00:09:07,730 --> 00:09:09,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">10%, huh...</font>

174
00:09:17,820 --> 00:09:19,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As you guys know</font>

175
00:09:19,990 --> 00:09:22,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the situation in the village
is currently very grave...</font>

176
00:09:23,290 --> 00:09:26,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We don't have the leeway of allowing
even Genin to sit around and play.</font>

177
00:09:27,540 --> 00:09:31,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However fortunately or unfortunately
Kurenai has been hospitalized</font>

178
00:09:32,050 --> 00:09:35,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">so you guys Team 8
no longer have a mission.</font>

179
00:09:36,800 --> 00:09:38,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Rather than just letting
you sit around and play</font>

180
00:09:38,720 --> 00:09:42,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'd rather place my bet
on that 10% possibility.</font>

181
00:09:42,600 --> 00:09:44,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh... you mean...</font>

182
00:09:46,310 --> 00:09:49,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Aburame Shino. Inuzuka Kiba.
Hyuga Hinata.</font>

183
00:09:50,150 --> 00:09:52,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I order you to search for
the Bikochu!</font>

184
00:09:53,070 --> 00:09:53,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— All right!
— All right!</font>

185
00:09:53,980 --> 00:09:55,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I designate Shino
as the leader this time.</font>

186
00:09:56,700 --> 00:09:59,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And... that spy up there!</font>

187
00:10:05,990 --> 00:10:07,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oww...!</font>

188
00:10:07,750 --> 00:10:09,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...</font>

189
00:10:09,120 --> 00:10:10,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're going to go even if
I try to stop you right?</font>

190
00:10:11,090 --> 00:10:11,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yup!</font>

191
00:10:12,920 --> 00:10:14,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In that case I have no choice
but to let you go...</font>

192
00:10:15,920 --> 00:10:16,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However...</font>

193
00:10:17,800 --> 00:10:19,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is your last chance.</font>

194
00:10:19,800 --> 00:10:22,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you don't find the Bikochu...</font>

195
00:10:22,550 --> 00:10:24,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you must give up on Sasuke!</font>

196
00:10:24,700 --> 00:10:26,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Wha...?
— You understand?!</font>

197
00:10:27,060 --> 00:10:30,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It'll be fine...
I'll find it without fail.</font>

198
00:10:30,580 --> 00:10:32,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right. You won't go back
on your word right?</font>

199
00:10:32,980 --> 00:10:36,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah! Leave it to me!</font>

200
00:10:37,110 --> 00:10:38,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're easily pleased, aren't you?</font>

201
00:10:38,950 --> 00:10:40,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Owww!</font>

202
00:10:41,200 --> 00:10:42,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...</font>

203
00:10:57,260 --> 00:10:58,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke...</font>

204
00:11:05,720 --> 00:11:06,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata.</font>

205
00:11:08,640 --> 00:11:09,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Good morning.</font>

206
00:11:10,980 --> 00:11:12,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Neji will be here soon
for his training...</font>

207
00:11:13,480 --> 00:11:15,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please prepare tea as always.</font>

208
00:11:15,150 --> 00:11:16,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well...</font>

209
00:11:16,610 --> 00:11:17,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? What's the matter?</font>

210
00:11:18,530 --> 00:11:20,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I need to go...
on a mission starting now...</font>

211
00:11:20,950 --> 00:11:21,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A mission, huh...</font>

212
00:11:22,360 --> 00:11:23,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In that case it can't be helped...</font>

213
00:11:24,200 --> 00:11:25,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm heading out...</font>

214
00:11:27,290 --> 00:11:30,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't be a burden to the others.</font>

215
00:11:32,750 --> 00:11:33,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes sir!</font>

216
00:11:45,510 --> 00:11:48,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm... I'm sorry! I'm in a hurry...</font>

217
00:11:51,690 --> 00:11:53,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The way she handled
her physical response just now...</font>

218
00:11:54,690 --> 00:11:55,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata...</font>

219
00:11:58,610 --> 00:12:00,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're late, Hinata!</font>

220
00:12:01,240 --> 00:12:02,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry!</font>

221
00:12:04,570 --> 00:12:07,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right then! Let's head out!</font>

222
00:12:07,240 --> 00:12:09,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's go!</font>

223
00:12:11,540 --> 00:12:12,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

224
00:12:12,960 --> 00:12:15,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why are you walking at
such a leisurely pace?!</font>

225
00:12:15,710 --> 00:12:17,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It takes a Shinobi two days on foot</font>

226
00:12:17,750 --> 00:12:19,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to get to the habitat of
the Bikochu...</font>

227
00:12:20,170 --> 00:12:21,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no need to make haste
from the very start.</font>

228
00:12:26,550 --> 00:12:30,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But what if the eggs hatch
before we get there?</font>

229
00:12:30,220 --> 00:12:34,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The eggs of Bikochu only hatch
on the day after it's rained...</font>

230
00:12:34,650 --> 00:12:36,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no sign of it
raining any time soon...</font>

231
00:12:36,520 --> 00:12:38,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But... if by some remote chance...</font>

232
00:12:38,400 --> 00:12:39,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto.</font>

233
00:12:39,320 --> 00:12:40,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wh-What is it?</font>

234
00:12:40,900 --> 00:12:42,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I am the leader of this team.</font>

235
00:12:43,280 --> 00:12:45,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">While we are on this mission
you will obey the orders of your leader.</font>

236
00:12:52,290 --> 00:12:56,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kiba, I can't believe you're able
to work with that kind of guy...</font>

237
00:12:57,500 --> 00:12:59,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well I've gotten used to it...</font>

238
00:13:00,250 --> 00:13:02,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sure you'll bond with him too, Naruto.</font>

239
00:13:04,300 --> 00:13:05,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder about that...</font>

240
00:13:13,560 --> 00:13:15,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto and the others
left a while ago.</font>

241
00:13:16,600 --> 00:13:17,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see.</font>

242
00:13:18,150 --> 00:13:20,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Didn't you want to go too?</font>

243
00:13:22,230 --> 00:13:23,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When it comes to searching
for insects</font>

244
00:13:23,530 --> 00:13:25,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shino who's an insect handler
is number one...</font>

245
00:13:26,070 --> 00:13:28,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And then Hinata who has Byakugan...</font>

246
00:13:28,780 --> 00:13:30,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and Kiba and Akamaru who have
sensitive noses are there too...</font>

247
00:13:31,410 --> 00:13:33,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So there's really no role that
I could play!</font>

248
00:13:34,370 --> 00:13:36,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What I must do right now...</font>

249
00:13:36,120 --> 00:13:39,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">is to become a Medical Ninja
as soon as I possibly can!</font>

250
00:13:49,010 --> 00:13:50,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's the matter, Shino?!</font>

251
00:13:50,890 --> 00:13:53,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The sun's going down.
We're setting up camp.</font>

252
00:13:53,290 --> 00:13:54,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Got it.
— Huh?
— Okay.</font>

253
00:13:55,180 --> 00:13:56,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? What...?!</font>

254
00:13:56,890 --> 00:13:58,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're gonna set up
camp already?!</font>

255
00:13:58,940 --> 00:14:03,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not tired at all yet!
Let's go further!</font>

256
00:14:04,780 --> 00:14:07,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, the leader of
this team is me.</font>

257
00:14:09,820 --> 00:14:12,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I-I understand!</font>

258
00:14:13,240 --> 00:14:14,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay then... let's sleep.</font>

259
00:14:14,790 --> 00:14:16,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh... we're gonna sleep already?!</font>

260
00:14:17,410 --> 00:14:21,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Many animals and plants
go to sleep at sunset</font>

261
00:14:21,210 --> 00:14:22,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and awake at sunrise.</font>

262
00:14:23,420 --> 00:14:24,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In order to search for insects</font>

263
00:14:24,800 --> 00:14:28,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">we must understand the rhythm
of living creatures with our own bodies...</font>

264
00:14:28,340 --> 00:14:31,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But... the sun's just set...</font>

265
00:14:32,050 --> 00:14:34,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, I am the leader of this team...</font>

266
00:14:34,260 --> 00:14:37,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay, okay. I got it!</font>

267
00:14:39,310 --> 00:14:42,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no way
I can sleep so early...</font>

268
00:14:45,190 --> 00:14:46,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah right...</font>

269
00:14:46,610 --> 00:14:49,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All that complaining and guess
who's the first one to fall asleep?</font>

270
00:15:20,600 --> 00:15:21,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have to pee...</font>

271
00:15:33,740 --> 00:15:34,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

272
00:15:34,830 --> 00:15:35,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

273
00:15:36,540 --> 00:15:37,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's that?</font>

274
00:15:47,500 --> 00:15:48,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a waterfall...</font>

275
00:15:50,470 --> 00:15:52,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey... Is somebody there?</font>

276
00:16:15,280 --> 00:16:16,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">S-Say...</font>

277
00:16:20,120 --> 00:16:21,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it...!</font>

278
00:16:22,120 --> 00:16:24,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">S-Sorry. Did I scare you?</font>

279
00:16:25,420 --> 00:16:26,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

280
00:16:29,250 --> 00:16:31,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's nobody there...</font>

281
00:16:39,310 --> 00:16:41,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh, Naruto...
Did you catch a cold?</font>

282
00:16:41,560 --> 00:16:42,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah... a little...</font>

283
00:16:46,440 --> 00:16:48,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">After sleeping so much
you're still tired?</font>

284
00:16:49,320 --> 00:16:50,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well uh...</font>

285
00:16:50,530 --> 00:16:53,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When I woke up last night to pee
I saw something awesome...</font>

286
00:16:54,780 --> 00:16:55,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Did you catch a cold too, Hinata?</font>

287
00:16:56,450 --> 00:16:58,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, I'm okay...</font>

288
00:16:58,370 --> 00:17:00,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And... what was that awesome thing?</font>

289
00:17:00,580 --> 00:17:03,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was a beautiful woman
in the middle of the waterfall!</font>

290
00:17:03,660 --> 00:17:04,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

291
00:17:05,120 --> 00:17:08,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When that person moved her arms
the water would suddenly move too!</font>

292
00:17:09,250 --> 00:17:10,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was awesome!</font>

293
00:17:11,090 --> 00:17:11,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And what happened then...</font>

294
00:17:12,010 --> 00:17:15,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When I tried to speak to her
she suddenly vanished.</font>

295
00:17:16,050 --> 00:17:18,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You must have been dreaming
or something.</font>

296
00:17:21,720 --> 00:17:23,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's starting to feel that way...</font>

297
00:17:23,810 --> 00:17:25,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You idiot!</font>

298
00:17:25,730 --> 00:17:27,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your face is red, Hinata.</font>

299
00:17:28,060 --> 00:17:29,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You might have really
caught a cold.</font>

300
00:17:30,110 --> 00:17:32,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh... really I'm fine...</font>

301
00:17:37,240 --> 00:17:40,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This fruit is edible.
This will be our meal today.</font>

302
00:17:41,290 --> 00:17:42,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Got it.</font>

303
00:17:44,290 --> 00:17:46,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We can save on
our food supplies too.</font>

304
00:17:47,670 --> 00:17:49,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's one thing
I need to warn you about.</font>

305
00:17:50,210 --> 00:17:53,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">On rare occasions this fruit grows
to the size of a human being.</font>

306
00:17:53,590 --> 00:17:55,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However those fruits
are damaged inside.</font>

307
00:17:55,590 --> 00:17:57,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't tamper with them
under any circumstance.</font>

308
00:17:57,090 --> 00:17:59,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's nobody who would
eat something that huge.</font>

309
00:18:00,550 --> 00:18:02,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">N-Naruto...!</font>

310
00:18:03,850 --> 00:18:04,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's eating it...</font>

311
00:18:13,320 --> 00:18:15,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto... We're going on ahead...</font>

312
00:18:15,780 --> 00:18:18,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll... I'll be right behind you!</font>

313
00:18:18,820 --> 00:18:19,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sorry to keep you waiting!</font>

314
00:18:24,790 --> 00:18:27,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait just a second!</font>

315
00:18:52,650 --> 00:18:55,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey... aren't we there yet?</font>

316
00:18:57,820 --> 00:18:58,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes.</font>

317
00:18:59,740 --> 00:19:00,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're here!</font>

318
00:19:00,780 --> 00:19:01,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What...?</font>

319
00:19:08,910 --> 00:19:10,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wow!</font>

320
00:19:11,460 --> 00:19:13,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've never seen anything
like this before.</font>

321
00:19:14,250 --> 00:19:16,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This certainly isn't a place
where humans could inhabit.</font>

322
00:19:17,460 --> 00:19:20,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right...
That's why it's paradise for insects.</font>

323
00:19:21,640 --> 00:19:23,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">D-Don't tell me...</font>

324
00:19:24,720 --> 00:19:26,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Could it be that... over there...?</font>

325
00:19:27,310 --> 00:19:29,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You mean that's where
the Bikochu are?</font>

326
00:19:29,730 --> 00:19:32,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No problem.
It's better than the Chunin Exam.</font>

327
00:19:37,070 --> 00:19:40,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn... The foothold crumbles easily...</font>

328
00:19:40,950 --> 00:19:42,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Naruto...
— What?</font>

329
00:19:43,910 --> 00:19:45,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As the leader I'm warning you...</font>

330
00:19:46,330 --> 00:19:47,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At a time like this
what is it?!</font>

331
00:19:48,500 --> 00:19:49,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't fall.</font>

332
00:19:49,500 --> 00:19:53,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I already know that
without your telling me!</font>

333
00:19:54,040 --> 00:19:54,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

334
00:19:57,500 --> 00:19:59,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No way...!</font>

335
00:20:04,720 --> 00:20:05,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That was close...</font>

336
00:20:08,010 --> 00:20:09,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those were insects, huh...</font>

337
00:20:09,980 --> 00:20:11,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's why I warned you.</font>

338
00:20:13,600 --> 00:20:14,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When this mission is over</font>

339
00:20:14,860 --> 00:20:17,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm definitely gonna kick
that guy's butt!</font>

340
00:20:23,490 --> 00:20:25,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is... the Bikochu forest.</font>

341
00:20:30,410 --> 00:20:31,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's go.</font>

342
00:20:42,590 --> 00:20:45,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no mistake.
Those are Leaf Shinobi.</font>

343
00:20:45,970 --> 00:20:48,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The fact that those guys came to
a place like this</font>

344
00:20:48,050 --> 00:20:49,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">means their objective is...</font>

345
00:20:50,810 --> 00:20:55,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah... it's the same as ours...
the Bikochu.</font>

346
00:20:55,100 --> 00:20:57,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're not gonna let them
take any Bikochu.</font>

347
00:20:57,770 --> 00:21:02,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Bikochu...
belong to us the Kamizuru Clan!</font>

