00:22:14,710 --> 00:22:26,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="23"><font face="Segoe UI"><b><font color="#cdfbff">katamuku sekai mo warui yatsura mo kechirashiteku yeah yeah yeah yeah</font></b></font></font></font>

369
00:22:14,710 --> 00:22:26,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="23"><font face="Segoe UI"><b><font color="#cdfbff">I'll take this sinking world, all its evil bastards, and kick their butts, yeah</font></b></font></font></font>

370
00:22:38,920 --> 00:22:40,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Huh! If you're talking about
the insect in this photograph</font>

371
00:22:41,040 --> 00:22:42,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">I'm very familiar with it.</font>

372
00:22:42,290 --> 00:22:43,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">— Huh?
— Really?!</font>

373
00:22:43,670 --> 00:22:47,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Damn... Don't tell me
that was a Bikochu?</font>

374
00:22:47,800 --> 00:22:48,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Where did you see it?</font>

375
00:22:48,930 --> 00:22:51,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">I heard some rustling in the kitchen
in the middle of the night</font>

376
00:22:51,510 --> 00:22:52,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">and I unintentionally threw
a slipper at it...
Wait a second...</font>

377
00:22:53,390 --> 00:22:54,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">N-Naruto...</font>

378
00:22:55,270 --> 00:22:58,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">What you're talking about
is an ordinary cockroach.</font>

379
00:22:59,230 --> 00:23:04,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Next time:
